<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25131" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλελῠμένως</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>laxly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				900a24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not in composition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.676f
			</span></i>; e.g. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδας ὠκύς,</span> as
			compared with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδώκης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				64.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>in an uncontracted form,</i> e.g. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκέα,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκῆ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Moer.
				414
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>without conjunctions, in asyndeton,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.500
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>in conversational style,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμέτρως,</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				p.115
			</span></i> C., cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				937
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
